的日历扩展替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/38925","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11738","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/56863","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11738","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0972.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-0972.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0972.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1af5ba0d141308335b96a6a04ad346f83977335a/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0972.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2010-0972-1522.yaml","https://github.com/1in9e/gosint/blob/bdda4461515c4398c08638676bbbfe451b73ff95/client/vuln_scan/nuclei/tools/nuclei-templates/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0972.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-0972_44.yaml","https://github.com/abh2technology/abh2-custom-templates-nucleiengine/blob/c7ba146f8016161974a9cf9f812ae7f225d23065/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0972.yaml","https://github.com/westonsteimel/national-vulnerability-database/blob/2ce54d3744fd5bcac7a1e8c5fe748135d72fb2a6/data/2010/CVE-2010-0972.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2010/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0208","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0806","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Peer Objects 组件释放后使用漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 的 Peer Objects 组件（iepeers.dll）中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制网页，诱使用户访问后触发对已删除对象的无效指针访问，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 IE 6、6 SP1 及 IE 7 版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。微软已于 MS10-018 安全公告中发布修复补丁，且该漏洞在 2010 年 3 月已被在野利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0806"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-03-10T22:30:01.323","updated":"2026-06-16T23:16:52.753","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2010 年 4 月安全公告 MS10-018 (KB980182) 补丁，或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。对于无法立即打补丁的系统，可配置 Internet Explorer 将 Internet 区域安全级别设为「高」以禁用 ActiveX 控件和 Active Scripting，或使用 EMET 工具缓解利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/msrc/archive/2010/03/09/security-advisory-981374-released.aspx","http://osvdb.org/62810","http://secunia.com/advisories/38860","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/744549","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/advisory/981374.mspx","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/38615","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-068A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-089A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0567","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0744","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2010/ms10-018","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/56772","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A8446","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2010/ms10-018","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-0806","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16590","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-0806.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0806.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0806.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/MahdiHedhli/threatpedia/blob/9c95c1bcbb7ff89eda6c0a2154702b1ad72592e4/site/src/content/zero-days/microsoft-internet-explorer-cve-2010-0806.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2010-0806.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2010-0806.html","https://github.com/Fu-LLC/CyberFlipper/blob/907c81a4f062e8b8f58fe15af95dc6e69992e64c/badusb/CVE_Daily/2026-05-20/CVE-2010-0806_WINDOWS.txt","https://github.com/urule99/jsunpack-n/blob/c01f406fd1ac113838f5e9ede8c04a63ef0acd5d/rules","https://github.com/hahwul/mad-metasploit/blob/a718d5e7a95eec2283ab0f8b464649b5cfb191a4/archive/exploits/windows/remote/11683.rb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0208.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2010/EXP-AVE-2010-0208.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0008","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0944","title":"Joomla! JCollection 组件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 JCollection 组件（com_jcollection）存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 的 controller 参数传递 `../` 序列，绕过路径限制读取服务器上任意敏感文件（如配置文件、数据库凭据等）。该漏洞影响 Joomla! 中使用 com_jcollection 组件的版本，攻击无需身份认证，利用难度低。建议用户升级至官方修复版本或卸载受影响组件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0944"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-03-08T15:30:00.810","updated":"2026-06-16T23:17:11.117","remediation":"卸载 com_jcollection 组件或通过 Joomla 扩展管理器禁用该组件。如必须使用，在网站根目录 .htaccess 中添加规则阻止对 index.php 的 controller 参数传递目录遍历序列（如 `..%2f`），或部署 WAF 规则拦截路径遍历攻击载荷。升级 Joomla 核心至 2.5 以上版本也可降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1001-exploits/joomlajcollection-traversal.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/expl