认证即可通过向 index.php 的 jashowcase 动作中 controller 参数传递 `..`（点点）序列，绕过路径限制，读取服务器上任意敏感文件。该漏洞源于程序对用户输入的路径参数缺乏充分的过滤与校验，属于 CWE-22 路径遍历类漏洞，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。受影响版本为 Joomla! 使用 com_jashowcase 组件的相关部署。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0943"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-03-08T15:30:00.777","updated":"2026-06-16T23:17:11.003","remediation":"该组件发布于 2010 年且已停止维护，不存在官方补丁。建议立即从 Joomla 后台卸载 com_jashowcase 组件，改用其他仍在维护的 Joomla 展示类扩展（如 RSMediaGallery）替代。如无法立即卸载，可在网站根目录 .htaccess 中添加 RewriteRule 拦截 controller 参数中包含 ../ 的请求，或通过 WAF 规则过滤 controller 参数中的目录遍历序列作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1001-exploits/joomlajashowcase-traversal.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/33486","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11090","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/37692","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/55512","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11090","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0943.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-0943.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0943.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-0943.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2010-0943-1516.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-0943.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-0943_18.yaml","https://github.com/patrickmpalmer/exploit-prediction-calculator/blob/a048424e68e6b5ea7f4d32bf29dddd4eda342b01/data_gathering/data/exploited_cves.csv","https://github.com/0xelixer/new/blob/6f6dd4a43a