-0942.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2010-0942.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-0942-1508.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-0942-1509.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-0942-1511.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2010-0942.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Joomla/CVE-2010-0942.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2010-0942.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0005","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0759","title":"Core Design Joomla! Scriptegrator 插件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Core Design Scriptegrator 插件 1.4.1 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞。该漏洞位于 plugins/system/cdscriptegrator/libraries/highslide/js/jsloader.php 文件中，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 files[] 参数传入包含目录遍历序列（如 ../）的特制请求，实现任意文件读取。在特定配置下，该漏洞可被进一步利用为文件包含导致任意代码执行。此漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0759"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-02-27T00:30:00.883","updated":"2026-06-16T23:16:47.643","remediation":"立即升级 Core Design Scriptegrator 插件至最新版本（如已停止维护则彻底卸载该插件）。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器层面（如 .htaccess 或 Nginx 配置）对 plugins/system/cdscriptegrator/ 目录限制访问，并过滤 files[] 参数中的目录遍历序列（如 ../），仅允许白名单内的合法文件路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1002-exploits/joomlascriptegrator-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/38637","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11498","http://www.osvdb.org/62486","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/38296","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/56380","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0759.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0005.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0004","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0696","title":"JoomlaWorks AllVideos Joomla 插件目录遍历漏洞","description":"JoomlaWorks 开发的 Joomla! 组件 AllVideos (Jw_allVideos) 3.0 至 3.2 版本中的 includes/download.php 存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 file 参数传递经过特殊构造的 `./../.../` 序列绕过路径限制，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞允许未授权攻击者读取服务器上任意敏感文件（如配置文件、数据库凭据等），危害较大。CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中危漏洞，建议用户立即升级或停用受影响组件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0696"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-02-23T18:30:00.717","updated":"2026-06-16T23:16:40.280","remediation":"升级 JoomlaWorks AllVideos 插件至 3.3 及以上版本，或在 Joomla 后台卸载该插件并更换为官方维护的替代插件。若无升级条件，可删除 `includes/download.php` 文件中的 `file` 参数处理逻辑，或在 Web 服务器层（如 .htaccess）限制 `download.php` 的直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/62331","http://secunia.com/advisories/38587","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11447","http://www.joomlaworks.gr/content/view/77/34/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/38238","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11447","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0696.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-0696.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-0696.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2010-0696.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2010-0696.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-0696-1497.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-0696-1498.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-0696-1501.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-0696-1500.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2010-0696.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Joomla/CVE-2010-0696.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0168","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0188","title":"Adobe Acrobat 与 Reader LibTIFF 整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Reader 和 Acrobat 在解析 PDF 文件时，其捆绑的 LibTIFF 库存在整数溢出漏洞。攻击者可构造特制的 PDF 文档，诱使用户打开后触发整数溢出，导致应用程序崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Adobe Reader 及 Acrobat 8.2.1 之前版本和 9.3.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0188"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-02-22T13:00:02.127","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:40.397","remediation":"升级 Adobe Reader/Acrobat 至 8.2.1 或 9.3.1 及以上版本，此漏洞在 Adobe 安全公告 APSB10-07 中修复。对于无法升级的环境，可禁用浏览器 PDF 插件、设置 PDF 阅读器为受限模式或使用组策略禁用 JavaScript 执行作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-03/msg00004.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/38639","http://secunia.com/advisories/38915","http://securitytracker.com/id?1023601","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb10-07.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0114.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/38195","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0399","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/56297","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A8697","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-0188","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11787","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-0188.md","https://github.com/h2hconference/H2HCMagazine/blob/16d67dfef2048d5deb4fec02e9ff3a0f7fae3a74/oexploit/artigo1/CVE-2010-0188_Trigger.pdf","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0188","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-0188.json","https://github.com/jesparza/peepdf/blob/c74dc65c0ac7e506bae4f2582a2435ec50741f40/CHANGELOG","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/11283.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2010-0188.html","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2010-0188.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0168.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2010/EXP-AVE-2010-0168.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0124","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0162","title":"Mozilla Firefox 和 SeaMonkey 同源策略绕过跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 3.0.x 早于 3.0.18 版本、3.5.x 早于 3.5.8 版本以及 SeaMonkey 早于 2.0.3 版本存在安全绕过漏洞。由于浏览器未正确处理 application/octet-stream 内容类型的安全防护机制，当攻击者通过 embed 元素将服务端以 Content-Type: application/octet-stream 返回的 SVG 文档嵌入网页时，浏览器仍会将其作为 SVG 渲染执行。远程攻击者可利用此缺陷绕过同源策略（SOP），在包含嵌入 SVG 的页面中执行任意 JavaScript 脚本，进而实施跨站脚本攻击（XSS），窃取用户敏感信息。CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0162"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-02-22T13:00:02.093","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:36.027","remediation":"立即升级 Firefox 至 3.0.18 或 3.5.8 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.0.3 及以上版本。如暂时无法升级，可临时禁用浏览器对 SVG 内容的自动渲染，或通过 Web 应用防火墙过滤用户上传的 SVG 文件，并在服务器端严格校验文件 Content-Type，防止攻击者上传恶意 SVG 脚本绕过同源策略实施跨站脚本攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035346.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035367.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035426.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-03/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/37242","http://secunia.com/advisories/38847","http://www.debian.org/security/2010/dsa-1999","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:042","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2010/mfsa2010-05.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0112.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-895-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-896-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0405","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=455472","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/56363","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A10697","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A8631","https