0.x 用户应升级至 3.0.18 或更高版本，Firefox 3.5.x 用户应升级至 3.5.8 或更高版本，SeaMonkey 用户应升级至 2.0.3 或更高版本，以修复 Web Worker 数组数据类型处理不当导致的内存破坏漏洞。升级前建议清除浏览器缓存并重启浏览器，确保补丁完全生效。若暂无法立即升级，可临时在浏览器配置中禁用 Web Workers 功能作为缓解措施，降低被远程攻击者利用执行任意代码的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035346.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035367.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035426.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-03/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/37242","http://secunia.com/advisories/38847","http://www.debian.org/security/2010/dsa-1999","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:042","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2010/mfsa2010-02.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0112.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/510533/100/0/threaded","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-895-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-896-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0405","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-046","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=531222","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=533000","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=534051","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/56360","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A11166","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A8465","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2010/CVE-2010-0160.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d2be4eb036a20db5be632f5ca0ba66a631c4d156/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0160.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0160","https://github.com/mozilla/foundation-security-advisories/b