"CVE-2010-0232","title":"Microsoft Windows NTVDM 子系统内核权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 32 位 x86 平台上，当启用 16 位应用程序访问支持时，内核未能正确验证特定 BIOS 调用。本地攻击者可在线程环境块（TEB）中构造特制的 VDM_TIB 数据结构，调用 NtVdmControl 函数启动 Windows 虚拟 DOS 机（NTVDM）子系统，触发 #GP 陷阱处理程序（nt!KiTrap0D）的异常处理不当，导致权限提升至 Ring 0 级别。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 3.1 至 Windows 7 全系 32 位版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0232"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-01-21T19:30:00.900","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:45.537","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS10-015 提供的更新 (KB977165)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动安装。受影响系统包括 Windows 2000 SP4、XP SP2/SP3、Server 2003 SP2、Vista/SP1/SP2、Server 2008/SP2 及 Windows 7 32 位版本。如无法立即打补丁，可通过组策略启用「禁止访问 16 位应用程序」策略以禁用 NTVDM 子系统作为临时缓解措施：运行 gpedit.msc → 计算机配置 → 管理模板 → Windows 组件 → 应用程序兼容性 → 启用「禁止访问 16 位应用程序」。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/msrc/archive/2010/01/20/security-advisory-979682-released.aspx","http://lists.immunitysec.com/pipermail/dailydave/2010-January/006000.html","http://lock.cmpxchg8b.com/c0af0967d904cef2ad4db766a00bc6af/KiTrap0D.zip","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2010/Jan/341","http://secunia.com/advisories/38265","http://securitytracker.com/id?1023471","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/advisory/979682.mspx","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/509106/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/37864","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-040A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0179","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2010/ms10-015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/55742","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A8344","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-0232","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/11199","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a